{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Horizon 是專為 Apple 行事曆而設的智能整理工具，會把現有行程自動分類，並以儀錶板、簡報、小工具與 Siri 呈現重要事項。它適合工作與生活行程繁雜、希望快速掌握每日安排的使用者；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-42.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能分類與每日簡報</h2>\n<p>Horizon 會讀取 Apple 行事曆行程，透過裝置端 AI 自動分成 19 個類別，並從修正中學習。儀錶板以今天為先，配合每日與每週簡報、小工具及 Siri 顯示接下來的安排；亦可倒數關注事項、尋找空檔、集中處理邀請與重疊行程。分類全在裝置上完成，行程不會傳送到伺服器，亦無需建立帳戶。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-45-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-46-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-47-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-48-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-49-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-50-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Horizon: Calendar Highlights</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/horizon-calendar-highlights/id6761135453?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T00:21:09.990697+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T00:00:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:20.440839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T00:18:26.569711+00:00","content_hash":"6a535c8fbde3fe16b8d71f950494ba98be6b4ac82f712307c8ce2fb5926a404b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T00:21:09.990697+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}